            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamwe mu bakomoka kuri Gadi bava kuri Sawuli baja kwifatanya na Dawidi aho yari yinyegeje mu bugaragwa. Bari abahizi b’inkomezi, biteguriye kugwana kandi bazi gukoresha inkinzo n’icumu. Mu maso habo hari hateye ubwoba nk’ah’intambwe, kandi banyaruka nk’ingeregere iyo ziruka ku misozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo Bagadi bari abakuru b’ingabo; uwa nyuma mu nkomezi yashobora kugwana n’abantu ijana, umunyenkomezi kurusha abandi na we yashobora kugwana n’abantu igihumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo bajabutse Yorodani mu kwezi kwa mbere igihe rwari rwuzuye rwarenze inkombe, baca bakinagiza abantu bose baba mu biyaya vyaho babashwiragiriza mu buseruko no mu burengero bw’urwo ruzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi Babenyamini na bamwe mu Bayuda na bo baraza bifatanya na Dawidi aho yari yinyegeje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi arasohoka ahura na bo maze arababwira ati: “nimwaba muzanywe n’amahoro, no kumfasha, nditeguye kwifatanya namwe. Ariko nimwaba muzanywe no kungurisha ku bansi banje kandi ata kibi kinyagira, Imana ya ba sogokuruza nibibone hanyuma ibacire urubanza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Mpwemu aza kuri Amasayi, yarongora bamwe mirongo itatu, aravuga ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi arabakira abagira abakuru b’abagwanyi biwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamwe mu bakomoka kuri Manase bava mu ngabo za Isirayeli baja kwifatanya na Dawidi igihe yajana n’Abafilisitiya kugwanya Sawuli. We n’abantu biwe ntibafashije Abafilisitiya kuko abatware b’Abafilisitiya bamaze kugira inama, baciye bamusubiza inyuma. Bavuze bati: “Hamwe yokwihindukiza agasubiza hamwe na shebuja Sawuli, twohasiga agatwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe Dawidi yari asubiye i Zikulagi, ni ho abakomoka kuri Manase baja kwifatanya na we, ari bo: Adina, Yozabadi, Yediyayeli, Mikayeli, Yozabadi, Elihu na Ziletayi. Umwe wese yari arongoye umugwi w’ingabo igihumbi mu Bamanase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafasha Dawidi kugwanya abansi biwe, kuko bari abagwanyi b’abahizi, kandi bari abakuru b’ingabo mu ngabo ziwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi ku musi abantu baguma baza kwifatanya na Dawidi, gushika aho yagize ingabo nyinshi, nk’ingabo z’Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbere n’abandi Bisirayeli bose basigaye baremeza ko Dawidi ari we akwiye kubabera umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bantu bamara imisi itatu bari kumwe na Dawidi, barya banywa, kuko imiryango yabo yari yabagemuriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyongeye, n’abo hirya no hino gushika no mu Bisakari, Abazebuloni no mu Banafutali baraza bazanye ivyokurya ku ndogoba, ku ngamiya, ku nyumbu, no ku nka. Hariho n’ibintu vyinshi bigizwe n’ifu, n’insukoni zikaranze, inzabibu zikaranze, umuvinyu, amavuta, inka n’intama, kuko hari umunezero mwinshi mu Bisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
